<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n68096" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μῖσος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εος</span>, τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>hate, hatred</i>: </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>I.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, <i>hate borne</i> one, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ag.</u>
				1413
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ. ἐμποιεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>R.</u>
					351d
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ. ἔχειν πρός τινος</span> incur
			a man's <i>hatred</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				691d
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ. φέρεσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					And.
					2.9
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			
				Act.
			, <i>hate felt against</i> another, <i>grudge</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ Τροίας μ. ἀναφέρων πατρί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Or.</u>
					432
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				4.128
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μῖσος ἐντέτηκέ μοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>El.</u>
					1311
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Mx.</u>
				245d
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔχθρα καὶ μ. ἀλλήλων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Mem.</u>
					3.5.17
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μισεῖν τινα μῖσος ἐξαίσιον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Aristaenet.
					1.22
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> of persons,
				<i>hateful object</i>, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μίσημα</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Ag.</u>
				1411
			</span></i> (lyr.), <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Ant.</u>
				760
			</span></i>; esp. in addresses, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὦ μῖσος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Ph.</u>
					991
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>Med.</u>
				1323
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
